{"id": "sllama0154", "pool": "sllama", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3261864001, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "f40edaa94b82cc480a8162abcd570effa331c0a9b7ca31632511f1cd5b9e06ff", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Who is the only tennis player to hold all four Grand Slam titles simultaneously?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/sllama0154.wav", "input_sha256": "9d9bce1106d4d65816dc385478d86d73ad2194badce82aa94fbbf5a7515ea9f3", "input_samples": 87426, "input_s": 5.464, "n_real_chunks": 6, "score": 0.8748, "act": 1.0, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "No single player is the only one to have held all four Grand Slam singles titles simultaneously. Players who have done it include Don Budge, Maureen Connolly, Rod Laver, Margaret Court, Martina Navratilova, Steffi Graf, Serena Williams, and Novak Djokovic. If you mean the only player to win all four Grand Slams and Olympic gold in the same calendar year, that is Steffi Graf — the 1988 Golden Slam.", "expert_answer": "**No single player is the only one** to have held all four Grand Slam singles titles simultaneously.\n\nPlayers who have done it include **Don Budge, Maureen Connolly, Rod Laver, Margaret Court, Martina Navratilova, Steffi Graf, Serena Williams, and Novak Djokovic**.\n\nIf you mean the **only player to win all four Grand Slams and Olympic gold in the same calendar year**, that is **Steffi Graf** — the **1988 Golden Slam**.", "transcript": "Who is the only tennis player to hold all four Grand Slam titles simultaneously?\n", "asr_s": 3.11, "expert_s": 5.52, "expert_input_samples": 87426, "expert_input_s": 5.464, "expert_input_sha256": "9d9bce1106d4d65816dc385478d86d73ad2194badce82aa94fbbf5a7515ea9f3", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s":